orus + 75% Potassium + 25 kg Zinc Sulfate/ha\\\",\\n        hi: \\\"50% नाइट्रोजन + 100% फास्फोरस + 75% पोटाश + 25 किग्रा जिंक सल्फेट/हेक्टेयर\\\",\\n        as: \\\"৫০% নাইট্ৰ'জেন + ১০০% ফছফৰাচ + ৭৫% পটাছ + ২৫ কেজি জিংক চালফেট/হেক্টৰ\\\",\\n        es: \\\"50% Nitrógeno + 100% Fósforo + 75% Potasio + 25 kg Sulfato de Zinc/ha\\\"\\n      },\\n      top1: {\\n        en: \\\"25% Nitrogen top-dressing at active tillering (21-25 days after transplanting)\\\",\\n        hi: \\\"25% \n<truncated 60836 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\abasu\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\agrisense\\\\src\\\\data\\\\cropsData.js\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
